@startuml
title Sequence - UC-13 Quản lý phản hồi của người dùng
actor "Admin Dashboard" as AdminUI
actor "Student App" as StudentApp
participant "API Gateway" as API
participant "Auth Service" as Auth
participant "Analytics/Feedback Service" as FeedbackSvc
database "DB" as DB

== Sinh viên gửi phản hồi ==
StudentApp -> API : POST /feedback {title,content}
API -> Auth : validate token
Auth --> API : OK
API -> FeedbackSvc : create feedback
FeedbackSvc -> DB : insert
DB --> FeedbackSvc : ok
API --> StudentApp : created

== Admin xử lý phản hồi ==
AdminUI -> API : GET /feedback?status=NEW
API -> Auth : validate admin token
Auth --> API : OK
API -> FeedbackSvc : list feedback
FeedbackSvc -> DB : query
DB --> FeedbackSvc : data
FeedbackSvc --> API : list
API --> AdminUI : show

AdminUI -> API : PATCH /feedback/{id} {status}
API -> FeedbackSvc : update status
FeedbackSvc -> DB : update
DB --> FeedbackSvc : ok
API --> AdminUI : ok
@enduml